  "title": "Booksellers and journalists",
  "goal": "Name jobs and shops with -CI (gazeteci, kitapçı) and make nouns with -lIk (gözlük, kitaplık, bir haftalık, dört kişilik).",
  "points": ["gp-ci", "gp-lik"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "`-CI` names who makes, sells or does something, and often the shop: *gazeteci* (journalist), *kitapçı* (bookseller, bookshop). After f, s, t, k, ç, ş, h, p it is *-çI*. `-lIk` makes abstract nouns (*güzellik*), things for something (*gözlük*, *kitaplık*) and measures (*bir haftalık*, *dört kişilik*).",
    "see": "gp-ci"
  },
  "vocab": [
    {
